  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>As a (contemplation) talent, you gain a number of temporary hit points equal to 1/2 your associated ranks + your operative modifier (minimum 1). This stacks with itself up to a maximum equal to 4 × your associated ranks.</p>\n<p>These temporary hit points replenish each time you contemplate using this talent.</p>\n<p>While you are benefitting from these temporary hit points, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against emotion and pain effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
